{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Everyone who does these things, everyone who deals unjustly.</b> The meaning of ״כָּל עוֹשֵׂה אֵלֶּה״ — a stone and a stone, an ephah and an ephah; ״כֹּל עוֹשֵׂה עָוֶל״ — that which resembles these, so that you should not say that the decree of the verse applies only to these two things and not to their counterparts, therefore Scripture says ״כֹּל״ etc."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:18:56.192459912Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}